---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const breadcrumbList = [{"name": "Home", "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/"}, {"name": "Cookie Policy", "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/cookie-policy/"}];
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="Cookie Policy for True Joy Birthing. Learn about the cookies we use, how we handle GPC and DNT signals, and how to manage cookies in your browser."
  canonical="https://truejoybirthing.com/cookie-policy/"
  breadcrumbList={breadcrumbList}
  schema={{
    "@graph": [{
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Cookie Policy",
      "description": "Cookie Policy for True Joy Birthing products and services.",
      "url": "https://truejoybirthing.com/cookie-policy"
    }]
  }}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-tjb-cream pt-16 pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-tjb-gray">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-8">

      <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">This Cookie Policy explains how True Joy Birthing (operated by Agentic Trust) uses cookies and similar technologies on our website and mobile app. This policy should be read alongside our <a href="/privacy/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <!-- 1. What Are Cookies -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-cream-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Cookies are small text files that websites place on your device when you visit them. They allow the website to remember your actions and preferences over time and across pages. Cookies are widely used to make websites function more efficiently and to provide information to website owners. Similar technologies include web beacons, pixel tags, and local storage, which work in comparable ways.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Types of Cookies We Use -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal">2. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2.1 Essential Cookies</h3>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Our website is primarily static and does not require essential cookies for basic functionality. If we add features that require essential cookies in the future, we will update this policy.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-tjb-cream-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2.2 Functional Cookies</h3>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">We do not currently use functional cookies on our website. If we add features that require functional cookies in the future, we will update this policy accordingly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2.3 Analytics Cookies</h3>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand how visitors use our website — which pages are visited, how long visitors stay, and how they arrived at our site. This helps us improve our content and user experience. The data collected by GA4 is aggregated and anonymized; it does not identify you personally. GA4 is loaded only after the page has loaded, which means it does not impact your initial page load experience.</p>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-2">Our mobile app uses different tracking technologies (such as SDKs and device identifiers) governed by our Privacy Policy, not cookies.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-tjb-rose-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-rose-200/50">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2.4 No Advertising Cookies</h3>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">We do not use advertising cookies. We do not set cookies for the purpose of delivering personalized ads, retargeting, or ad performance measurement. We do not participate in cross-site advertising cookie networks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Third-Party Cookies -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Some cookies on our website are set by third-party services that help us operate or improve our site. These include:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-tjb-gray mt-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Google Analytics:</strong> Set by Google to collect anonymized usage data. Google's privacy policy applies to data collected via these cookies.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><strong class="text-tjb-charcoal">Apple App Store:</strong> If you click an App Store link, Apple may set cookies on its own domain. We do not control these cookies.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-3">We do not control third-party cookies, and their use is governed by the respective third parties' privacy policies. We encourage you to review those policies.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Managing Cookies in Your Browser -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-cream-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">4. Managing Cookies in Your Browser Settings</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">You can control and delete cookies through your browser settings. Most browsers allow you to:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-tjb-gray mt-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span>View all cookies currently stored on your device.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span>Block cookies from specific websites or all websites.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span>Delete cookies that have already been set.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span>Set your browser to ask for confirmation before accepting cookies.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-3">Instructions vary by browser. You can find guidance for popular browsers here:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-tjb-gray mt-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Chrome</a></span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-and-website-data-sfri11471/mac" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Safari</a></span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Firefox</a></span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-tjb-lavender-500 mt-1">●</span> <span><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Microsoft Edge</a></span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed mt-3">Note that blocking all cookies may affect the functionality of our website and others you visit. Essential features may not work as intended if cookies are disabled.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Global Privacy Control (GPC) -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-rose-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-rose-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">5. Global Privacy Control (GPC)</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">We honor GPC signals as required under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA) and other applicable state privacy laws, including the Virginia Consumer Data Protection Act, Colorado Privacy Act, and Connecticut Data Privacy Act. When your browser sends a GPC signal, we treat it as a request to opt out of the sale or sharing of your personal information. We do not sell your personal information. If we detect a GPC signal, our analytics tools are configured to respect that signal and limit data collection accordingly.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Do Not Track (DNT) -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">6. Do Not Track (DNT) Signals</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">Do Not Track is a browser setting that signals your preference not to be tracked across websites. We respect DNT signals. When we detect a DNT signal from your browser, we limit the analytics data we collect to anonymized, aggregate information that cannot be used to identify you. We do not use DNT signals to deny you access to any features of our website.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Changes to This Policy -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. We will notify you of material changes by posting the updated policy with a revised "Last updated" date. Your continued use of our services after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 8. Contact -->
      <div class="bg-tjb-cream-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-tjb-lavender-200/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-tjb-charcoal mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed">If you have questions about this Cookie Policy or our use of cookies, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@truejoybirthing.com" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors">support@truejoybirthing.com</a>.</p>
        <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-tjb-gray">
          <p>Agentic Trust</p>
          <p>217 6th Ave N STE 43363</p>
          <p>Nashville, TN 37219</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Related links -->
      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-tjb-lavender-200/50 text-center">
        <p class="text-tjb-gray mb-4">Related: <a href="/privacy/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors font-semibold">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms/" class="text-tjb-rose-500 hover:text-tjb-charcoal underline underline-offset-3 transition-colors font-semibold">Terms of Use</a></p>
        <a href="/" class="btn-primary">Back to Home →</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>